<title>USA: Cablevision to carry News Corp's Fox.</title>
<headline>Cablevision to carry News Corp's Fox.</headline>
<dateline>WOODBURY, N.Y. 1996-10-01</dateline>
<text>
<p>News Corp and Cablevision Systems Corp said on Tuesday they have entered into an agreement under which Cablevision will offer customers the 24-hour Fox News Channel.</p>
<p>The channel will be offered to customers in Long Island, Connecticut, New Jersey, Boston and greater Cleveland, the companies said.</p>
<p>With this latest agreement, the Fox News Channel will reach more than 14 million cable viewers when it premieres October 7.</p>
</text>
